    "regime_notes": "60-session IC was -0.05528 in 2020-2023, +0.05931 in 2024-2026, +0.11677 in 2027-2029, +0.19285 in 2030-2032, and -0.05316 in 2033-2034. Strongly regime-dependent; recent 2033-2034 deterioration requires monitoring.",
